  "interpretation": "The host packet-capture point observed 2592 UDP datagram records addressed to EGO socket port 62427 over the 2.485 s successful-take gap; records bracketed almost the full interval and the largest observed inter-record gap was 25.4 ms. EGO RMW wait still returned unread_count=0 673 times, then ready with 15 at the interval end. This rules against a complete absence of UDP traffic to that participant port at the host capture point during the interval. It does not prove these datagrams were camera_pose DATA, that the UDP socket accepted them, or that Fast DDS inserted them into the DataReader history. The socket drop count rose by 90 and sampled receive memory peaked at 465220 bytes, while sample_lost/rejected status remained zero. Capture kernel drops, socket-level counters, and the lack of RTPS/topic parsing prevent a causal attribution.",
